{"chapter-slug":"rw7-20","paragraph":1107,"wording":"[Lady of Pride]","event":"named","holder-quote":"The Balerosian woman was nodding and showing Pryde an image. The [Lady of Pride] hesitated as she blinked at the image. Wuvren murmured.","id":"fe69f4d1-eaa0-5203-ab63-c896e786597f"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-20","paragraph":1426,"wording":"[Lady of Pride]","event":"named","holder-quote":"“Of course! Pryde, what are you so fascinated by?”","id":"142fc626-0c18-5e92-8ed8-09a384884303"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-23 LM","paragraph":628,"wording":"[Lady of Pride]","event":"named","holder-slug":"lady-pryde","holder-quote":"Lady Pryde Ulta stood in the inn. Erin froze with her hand on the doorknob. The [Lady of Pride] looked around, and her eyes flashed imperiously.","id":"62600d4b-4d38-51d3-9af3-9e85a7ab44c9"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-23 LM","paragraph":646,"wording":"[Lady of Pride]","event":"named","holder-slug":"lady-pryde","holder-quote":"This time Lyonette felt the aura condensing around Pryde. The [Lady] nearly stumbled. She turned.","id":"75140184-7d7d-5954-9f07-874bd0b439be"}
{"chapter-slug":"rw7-23 LM","paragraph":761,"wording":"[Lady of Pride]","event":"named","holder-slug":"lady-pryde","holder-quote":"It was so funny. Lyonette loved money. But this was her inn. No one walked in and made demands of her. She ignored Pryde’s aura; the [Lady] was still looking at her like a [Barmaid].","id":"689f3c5b-39c5-5833-9dbe-c111821f4dcc"}
